{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Make Postnatal Mental Health Training Mandatory for Employers",
        "additional_details": "1. Mandatory postnatal mental-health training for employers \u2013 understanding PND, its symptoms and its impact on work.\r\n2. Clear guidance for managers \u2013 supporting employees returning from maternity leave without assumptions or stigma.\r\n3. Stronger protection from discrimination \u2013 ensuring employees aren\u2019t disadvantaged because of postnatal mental-health difficulties.\r\n4. A workplace support pathway \u2013 requiring employers to have clear policies and appropriate support for postnatal mental health.",
        "background": "Consistent requirement for employers to understand postnatal mental health and recognise how it can affect somebody returning to work.",
